Patch kit 4 is tentatively scheduled for release on
Monday (Sep. 25).  The main features of Patch 4 will be
a full color support and a VMS port.  A Mac port is in
the works, but we do not know whether it will arrive in 
time to be included in Patch 4.

The continual flow of bug reports, bug fixes, and suggestions
is gratifying.  Due to an increased professional and academic
demand on our time, some msgs were not as promptly answered
as in the past, and some were acted upon but, for some reason,
not answered (cases where each of us was expecting someone
else to answer..).  We appologize for such mishaps, and please
keep sending those notices.

For the development team,

-Izchak


